From d615fb6000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sisyphus <sisyphus@ohmyopencode>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] airoha: size optimizations for Nokia XG-040G-MF to fit 512KB bootloader partition

Remove non-essential features and reduce buffers to get u-boot.bin under
512KB (mtd0 = 512KB) while preserving all critical functionality.

Changes:
- BOOTDELAY: 3->0 (fast boot, still interruptible via bootdelay=0 + reset)
- Remove: AUTOBOOT_MENU_SHOW, FIT_VERBOSE, SYS_CONSOLE_IS_IN_ENV,
  CMD_LICENSE, CMD_ASKENV, CMD_ERASEENV, CMD_ENV_FLAGS, CMD_RNG,
  CMD_STRINGS, CMD_MTD_MARKBAD, CMD_MTD_NAND_READ_TEST,
  CMD_MTD_NAND_WRITE_TEST, CMD_PART, CMD_TFTPSRV, CMD_RARP, CMD_DNS,
  CMD_PXE, CMD_CACHE, CMD_UUID, CMD_HASH, CMD_SMC, CMD_UBI_RENAME,
  CMD_MII, CMD_MDIO, VERSION_VARIABLE, NETCONSOLE, BUTTON, BUTTON_GPIO,
  LED_BLINK, SHA512, PHY_AIROHA_EN8811, PHY_ANEG_TIMEOUT,
  PHY_ETHERNET_ID
- SYS_RX_ETH_BUFFER: 8->4 (halve receive buffer to save ~1KB)
- Force-disable auto-enabled features with "# CONFIG_* is not set"

Preserved: UBI, MTD, SPI-NAND, SPI-NOR, Ethernet, DHCP, PING, WGET (HTTP
upgrade), FIT, HUSH parser, GPIO, MTD commands, all SPI flash vendors.

Before: 125 CONFIG_ options (after 904)
After:  98 CONFIG_ options + 58 force-disabled

Signed-off-by: Sisyphus <sisyphus@ohmyopencode>
---

diff --git a/configs/an7583_nokia_xg-040g-mf_defconfig b/configs/an7583_nokia_xg-040g-mf_defconfig
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/configs/an7583_nokia_xg-040g-mf_defconfig
+++ b/configs/an7583_nokia_xg-040g-mf_defconfig
 CONFIG_ARM=y
 CONFIG_POSITION_INDEPENDENT=y
 CONFIG_ARCH_AIROHA=y
-CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=3
+CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=0
 CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_KEYED=y
-CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_MENU_SHOW=y
 CONFIG_TARGET_AN7583=y
 CONFIG_TEXT_BASE=0x81E00000
 CONFIG_SYS_MALLOC_F_LEN=0x4000
